  "rules": [
    "A file has exactly one primary owner; contributors may edit only through a pull request the owner approves, never concurrently.",
    "A change to a frozen interface (interface-specifications.json) goes through the coordinator and is versioned; consumers are notified before merge.",
    "F# compile order is the order of each project's files list; a file may depend only on earlier files of its project or on referenced projects.",
    "ui and ui-2 never own the same file; Shell.fs is ui's and ui-2 consumes it read-only.",
    "Integration alone writes: every project and solution file, Directory.*.props, global.json, package.json, package-lock.json, playwright.config.ts, build.fsx, README.md, .github/, web/, .echelon/, tests/fixtures/manifest.json, src/Causa.Host/, src/Causa.App/View.fs and src/Causa.App/Program.fs (check X02)."
  ],
